  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "libnfs security update",
      "Title": "Synopsis",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for libnfs is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Package contains a library of functions for accessing NFSv2 and NFSv3 servers from user space. It provides a low-level,asynchronous RPC library for accessing NFS protocols, an asynchronous library with POSIX-like VFS functions,and a synchronous library with POSIX-like VFS functions.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nZDR decoding in libnfs through 6.0.2 before 7613236 has an out-of-bounds write related to lib/libnfs-zdr.c with libnfs_zdr_bytes(), libnfs_zdr_string(), and libnfs_zdr_array(). The caller-supplied maxsize value is not honored.(CVE-2026-108985)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for libnfs is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of high. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "High",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "libnfs",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
